<p>In addition to the Neon CLI <a class="" href="/docs/reference/neon-cli#global-options">global options</a>, the <code>projects</code> subcommand supports this option:</p>
<div class="table-wrapper"><table><thead><tr><th>Option</th><th>Description</th><th>Type</th><th style="text-align:center">Required</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td><code>--context-file</code></td><td><a class="" href="/docs/reference/cli-set-context#using-a-named-context-file">Context file</a> path and file name</td><td>string</td><td style="text-align:center"></td></tr><tr><td><code>--org-id</code></td><td>List all projects belonging to the specified organization.</td><td>string</td><td style="text-align:center"></td></tr><tr><td><code>--recoverable-only</code></td><td>List only projects that can be recovered (deleted within the deletion recovery period).</td><td>boolean</td><td style="text-align:center"></td></tr></tbody></table></div>
